  "engineV3": {
    "_comment": "Engine v3 routes per role, best first ('provider:model'). Small fast models do brief/research/outline; the strongest free models do art direction, slide design and vision QA. A 429 or a used-up daily quota moves to the next route instantly. Override at runtime with ENGINE_V3_ROUTES (same shape as 'roles'). Use the /benchmark page to pick the best model per role on your own keys. Order (31 Oct 2026): free Gemini Flash first (best free designer on Design Arena votes), then Ollama Cloud's cheap paid models IF OLLAMA_API_KEY is set (OLLAMA_PRIORITY=last to use them only at the end), then OpenRouter free (Inkling > Nemotron 3.5 Super VL > Nemotron 3 Ultra on Design Arena), Gemma 4, Groq, Cloudflare. NVIDIA only with ALLOW_NVIDIA_PRODUCTION=true.",
